sequenceDiagram
    participant SDK as Kubeflow Pipelines SDK<br/>(Python Client)
    participant UI as Pipeline UI<br/>(Data Science Pipelines)
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant DB as MySQL/PostgreSQL<br/>3306 or 5432/TCP

    Note over SDK,DB: Flow 1: Pipeline Metadata Recording
    SDK->>MLMD: PutExecution / PutArtifacts / PutEvents<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS, None or mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE metadata entities<br/>MySQL/PostgreSQL protocol, Optional SSL<br/>Auth: Username/password
    DB-->>MLMD: Confirm write
    MLMD-->>SDK: Response with entity IDs

    Note over SDK,DB: Flow 2: Pipeline Metadata Retrieval
    UI->>MLMD: GetArtifactsByContext / GetExecutionsByContext<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS, None or mTLS
    MLMD->>DB: SELECT metadata queries<br/>MySQL/PostgreSQL protocol, Optional SSL<br/>Auth: Username/password
    DB-->>MLMD: Result rows
    MLMD-->>UI: Artifacts, Executions, Events

    Note over SDK,DB: Flow 3: Lineage Query
    SDK->>MLMD: GetLineageSubgraph<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS
    MLMD->>DB: Recursive lineage query<br/>MySQL/PostgreSQL protocol
    DB-->>MLMD: Lineage graph data
    MLMD-->>SDK: Lineage subgraph<br/>(Artifacts → Events → Executions)
